 ranachan: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/cranachan/\nTraditional S
 cottish Oatcakes: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/oatcakes/\nSmoky 
 Single Malt Whisky for Burns Night: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes
