 wined with courtly love through Chaucer's poetry and later Victorian card 
 exchanges.\nTraditions: Couples exchange handwritten notes\, roses\, and a
 cts of service\, while many support charitable causes in the spirit of sel
 fless love.\nFeasting: Sweethearts linger over chocolate-dipped strawberri
 es\, heart-shaped confections\, fine champagne\, and candlelit suppers for
  two.\nDay: Saturday\n\nIcon: 💕\nCategory: cultural\n\nAgenda: https://
