 , sing Sankt Martin songs\, and end with bonfires or shadow plays retellin
 g his compassion.\nFeasting: Warm cider\, pretzels\, roasted chestnuts\, a
 nd buttery pastries reward lantern bearers after the chilly evening walk.\
