SUMMARY:Gita Jayanti (गीता जयंती)
DESCRIPTION:History: Devotees honour the day Lord Krishna shared the Bhagav
 ad Gita with Arjuna on the Kurukshetra battlefield, aligning with the Marg
 ashirsha Shukla Ekadashi tithi.\nTraditions: Temples host full Bhagavad Gi
 ta recitations, scholars lead kirtans and discourse circles, and families 
 observe vrata fasts before offering diyas along rivers and at home altars.
 \nFeasting: After evening prayers, observers share satvik plates of khichd
 i, jaggery sweets, sugarcane juice, and warm cardamom milk to break the fa
 st.\nDay: Saturday\n\nIcon: 📜\nCategory: religious\n\nAgenda: https://m
