 /\nBimuelos (Hanukkah Honey Fritters): https://mss.castalia.institute/reci
 pes/bimuelos/\nClassic Hanukkah Braised Brisket: https://mss.castalia.inst
 itute/recipes/braised-brisket/\nSweet Noodle Kugel: https://mss.castalia.i
 nstitute/recipes/kugel/
