UID:christmas-day@maybesomethingseasonal.com
DTSTAMP:20251104T055848Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251225
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20251226
SUMMARY:Christmas Day
DESCRIPTION:History: By late antiquity the Western church fixed December 25
  as the Nativity feast\, intertwining with Sol Invictus imagery and evolvi
 ng into a global holiday.\nTraditions: People gather around decorated tree
 s\, sing carols\, exchange gifts\, and share charity with neighbours in th
 e spirit of goodwill.\nFeasting: Roast goose or turkey\, glazed ham\, pota
 toes\, Brussels sprouts\, Christmas pudding\, and yule logs anchor generou
 s holiday tables.\nDay: Thursday\n\nIcon: 🎄\nCategory: celebration\n\nA
 genda: https://mss.castalia.institute/agenda/christmas-day/\nRecipes:\nTra
 ditional Roast Goose: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/roast-goose/\
 nRoast Turkey: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/roast-turkey/\nChris
 tmas Glazed Ham: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/glazed-ham/\nCrisp
 y Roasted Potatoes: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/potatoes/\nRoas
 ted Brussels Sprouts with Bacon: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/br
 ussels-sprouts/\nTraditional Christmas Pudding: https://mss.castalia.insti
 tute/recipes/christmas-pudding/\nClassic Yule Log (Bûche de Noël): https
 ://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/yule-log/
CATEGORIES:celebration
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-IMAGE:/images/image33.png
URL:https://mss.castalia.institute/agenda/christmas-day/
END:VEVENT
