UID:feast-of-the-holy-innocents-childermas-banquet@maybesomethingseasonal.com
DTSTAMP:20251104T055848Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251228
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20251229
SUMMARY:Feast of the Holy Innocents (Childermas Banquet)
DESCRIPTION:History: Childermas commemorates the Bethlehem children slain u
 nder King Herod\; medieval English households kept 28 December as the Feas
 t of the Holy Innocents\, centring prayers and hospitality on the youngest
  family members.\nTraditions: Households set a whimsical winter table with
  white candles\, holly berries\, and silver bells\, portion dishes in chil
 d-sized servings\, and invite the youngest at table to announce each cours
 e as the day's presider.\nFeasting: A Childermas banquet pours Baby Bellin
 i aperitifs of sparkling wine or apple cider with white peach puree\, then
  cradles baby beet bisque swirled with creme fraiche and dill over star-cu
 t rye croutons\; baby greens toss with baby tomatoes\, carrots\, and corn 
 in honey-citrus vinaigrette with toasted almonds and edible flowers\; slow
 -smoked baby back ribs lacquered in pomegranate glaze and herb-roasted Cor
 nish hens with clementine pan jus arrive beside duck-fat roasted baby pota
 toes\, baby corn gratin with nutmeg-Parmesan crust\, and braised baby onio
 ns in balsamic reduction\; serve pillowy milk rolls with whipped honey but
 ter\, finish with baby cheesecakes topped in spiced pear-cranberry compote
  or tableside baby bananas Foster\, and toast with Babycham or warm milk p
 unch dusted with nutmeg.\nDay: Saturday\n\nIcon: 👶\nCategory: cultural\
 n\nAgenda: https://mss.castalia.institute/agenda/feast-of-the-holy-innocen
 ts-childermas-banquet/\nRecipes:\nBaby Bellini Aperitif: https://mss.casta
 lia.institute/recipes/baby-bellini-aperitif/\nBaby Beet Bisque: https://ms
 s.castalia.institute/recipes/baby-beet-bisque/\nSimple Baby Greens Salad w
 ith Vinaigrette: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/baby-greens-salad/
 \nSlow-Smoked Baby Back Ribs: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/slow-
 smoked-baby-back-ribs/\nHerb-Roasted Cornish Hens: https://mss.castalia.in
 stitute/recipes/herb-roasted-cornish-hens/\nDuck-Fat Roasted Baby Potatoes
 : https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/duck-fat-roasted-baby-potatoes/\n
 Baby Corn Gratin: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/baby-corn-gratin/
 \nBraised Baby Onions: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/braised-baby
 -onions/\nPillowy Milk Rolls: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/pillo
 wy-milk-rolls/\nWhipped Honey Butter: https://mss.castalia.institute/recip
 es/whipped-honey-butter/\nBaby Cheesecakes: https://mss.castalia.institute
 /recipes/baby-cheesecakes/\nTableside Baby Bananas Foster: https://mss.cas
 talia.institute/recipes/tableside-baby-bananas-foster/\nBabycham Childerma
 s Sparkle: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/babycham/\nWarm Milk Pun
 ch: https://mss.castalia.institute/recipes/warm-milk-punch/
CATEGORIES:cultural
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-IMAGE:/images/baby-back-ribs.jpg
URL:https://mss.castalia.institute/agenda/feast-of-the-holy-innocents-childermas-banquet/
END:VEVENT
